---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { featuredProjects } from '../data/projects';
import { links } from '../data/links';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="bsquidwrd"
  description="Squid. I write software for a living and build Discord bots and Twitch tooling on my own time."
>
  <section class="intro">
    <img src="/avatar.jpg" alt="" width="92" height="92" />
    <div class="intro-body">
      <p class="eyebrow">bsquidwrd</p>
      <h1>Hey, I&rsquo;m Squid.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        I write software for a living. Some of it is our product, some of it is the tool we use to
        get customers set up, and a lot of it is the AWS and Terraform underneath. On my own time I
        build Discord bots and Twitch tooling.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>About</h2>
    <p>
      Almost everything I&rsquo;ve put out there started as a problem I had. <a
        href="https://github.com/bsquidwrd/LiveBot">LiveBot</a
      > exists because I wanted my Discord server to announce when I went live so I didn&rsquo;t have
      to, and I&rsquo;ve been working on it ever since. The rest is Twitch API experiments, small
      tools for other admins, and whatever I&rsquo;m trying to learn at the time.
    </p>
    <p>
      Work is three different jobs depending on the day. Sometimes I&rsquo;m building features in our
      product. Sometimes I&rsquo;m in the internal tool we use to get each customer set up. A lot of
      the time I&rsquo;m underneath all of it, in Terraform and AWS and the pipelines that ship
      everything. Bouncing between them is my favorite part, because the same problem looks
      completely different from inside the app than it does from the infrastructure holding it up.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of work it&rsquo;s Go, C#, and Python, plus a homelab that mostly exists so I have
      somewhere to break things without consequences.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Selected projects</h2>
    <ul class="card-list">
      {
        featuredProjects.map((project) => (
          <li>
            <a class="card" href={project.url}>
              <div class="card-head">
                <h3>{project.name}</h3>
                <span class="meta">
                  {project.language && <span class="tag">{project.language}</span>}
                  {project.stars ? <span>{project.stars} &#9733;</span> : null}
                </span>
              </div>
              <p>{project.description}</p>
            </a>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
    <p class="more"><a href="/projects">See everything &rarr;</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
    <ul class="links">
      {
        links.map((link) => (
          <li>
            <a class="link-row" href={link.href}>
              <Icon name={link.icon} />
              <span>
                {link.label}
                <small>{link.note}</small>
              </span>
            </a>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
